IT:
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Che storia! Dai che si gioca!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Si decide tutto in un'{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}unica mano{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Se pareggiamo, però, si ripete!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}You're in for some trouble now!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}OK, whoever reaches {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0006:0000}} wins {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}first
will be named the grand champ!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Şimdi başın belada!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tamam, {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0006:0000}} galibiyete {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ilk ulaşan
